{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2023-03-29 07:30:00', 'title': 'DR POWER EQUIPMENT INTRODUCES BATTERY-POWERED BRUSH MOWER, ONE OF THE FIRST IN THE INDUSTRY', 'text': 'DR FB26E ELECTRIC FIELD AND BRUSH MOWER CUTS UP TO 90 MINUTES ON A SINGLE CHARGE SOUTH BURLINGTON, VT., MARCH 29, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DR POWER EQUIPMENT, A PROMINENT PRODUCER OF HIGH-QUALITY OUTDOOR POWER EQUIPMENT AND A GENERAC POWER SYSTEMS (NYSE: GNRC) COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED ONE OF THE FIRST BATTERY-POWERED BRUSH MOWERS AVAILABLE IN THE LANDSCAPE MARKET, THE DR FB26E ELECTRIC FIELD AND BRUSH MOWER.'}